@startuml
title SSD - UC-07 / UC-08 - History and Daily Streak

autonumber
actor Learner
participant "FocusDesktop System" as System

Learner -> System : requestSessionHistory(from, to, page, size)
System --> Learner : sessionPage(items, total, page, size)

Learner -> System : requestDailyStreak(date)
System --> Learner : streak(date, current, longest)

note right of System
  History is read-only and paginated.
  Streak is derived from completed work intervals
  of at least five minutes.
end note

@enduml
